<title>USA: L. Luria names Ilia Lekach chairman.</title>
<headline>L. Luria names Ilia Lekach chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>L. Luria &amp; Son Inc said it has appointed Ilia Lekach as chairman of its board of directors.</p>
<p>It also named Albert Friedman as chief financial officer and executive vice president.</p>
<p>Ilia Lekach succeeds Rachmil Lekach as chairman, but Rachmil Lekach will continue to serve as chief executive of the company.</p>
</text>
